Everyone is invited to take a look at a new program specially written to learn Lojban, with 2 modules (sentence pairs + sounds) ready so far - that's 344 sentences in total.
"Schliemann's" method of parallel reading (and thus, implicit learning) is used there.

The program is for Microsoft Windows 2000, XP, and newer

Read and download here: 

http://www.lojban.org/tiki/tiki-index.php?page=Parallel%202

Please, please post your opinions on the discussion section of that page, I'm very interested in them.
